<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2112974332"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1723506586"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Fine Day"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="平葵"/><amll:meta key="album" value="メメントモリ Lament Collection Vol.1 (3)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:24.404"><div begin="00:20.649" end="03:58.480"><p begin="00:20.649" end="00:24.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">何を泣いてるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你为何而哭泣呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni wo na i te ru no ?</span></p><p begin="00:25.959" end="00:30.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">折れ曲がった向日葵<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被折断倒地的向日葵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o re ma ga 't ta hi ma wa ri</span></p><p begin="00:31.336" end="00:40.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">抱きしめてあげる 大丈夫だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会紧紧抱住你的 一切会没事的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki shi me te a ge ru da i jo u bu da ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:41.623" end="00:46.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">二人で いいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两个人也没关系吗？温馨的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri de i i no ya sa shi i u ta</span></p><p begin="00:47.517" end="00:51.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">優しい歌<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这曲温柔的歌</span></p><p begin="00:52.810" end="00:57.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">だから ねえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 呐 请永远不要离开我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra ne e ha na sa na i de ne</span></p><p begin="00:58.185" end="01:02.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">離さないでね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要离开我</span></p><p begin="01:03.511" end="01:07.759" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Fine day ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天 一直 都出现在梦中吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Fine day zu 't to yu me wo mi te ta no</span></p><p begin="01:08.801" end="01:13.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">夢を見てたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都身处梦境之中</span></p><p begin="01:14.206" end="01:18.455" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">昨日も明日も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昨天也好明天也罢 全都充满着希望呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki no u mo a su mo ki bo u de nu ri tsu bu shi te</span></p><p begin="01:19.369" end="01:26.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">希望で塗りつぶして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用希望一笔涂抹</span></p><p begin="01:45.743" end="01:55.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">たとえ離れても みんな分かってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使终有一天会别离 大家都清楚的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ha na re te mo mi n na wa ka 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:56.479" end="02:05.931" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">あなた達の声 笑う顔も全部<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们的声音与笑颜也已是全部</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta ta chi no ko e wa ra u ka o mo ze n bu</span></p><p begin="02:06.938" end="02:11.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">それでも いいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此也无所谓了 能开心的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo i i yo ta no shi i na ra</span></p><p begin="02:12.757" end="02:17.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">楽しいなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能感到快乐</span></p><p begin="02:18.026" end="02:22.358" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">だけど ねえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是 呐 我就在这里不是吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do ne e ko ko ni i ru no ni</span></p><p begin="02:23.418" end="02:28.077" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">ここにいるのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明就在此处</span></p><p begin="02:28.741" end="02:33.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Fine day ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天 一直 想要在梦中看到呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Fine day zu 't to yu me wo mi ta i no</span></p><p begin="02:34.163" end="02:39.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">夢を見たいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都想做一场梦</span></p><p begin="02:39.464" end="02:49.718" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">深く 深く 砂の果てまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深入 深入 直到沙砾的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka ku fu ka ku su na no ha te ma de</span></p><p begin="02:50.115" end="02:51.576" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Good night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此晚安吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Good night</span></p><p begin="03:14.184" end="03:18.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Fine day ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天 一直 都出现在梦中吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Fine day zu 't to yu me wo mi te ta no</span></p><p begin="03:19.452" end="03:24.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">夢を見てたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直都身处梦境之中</span></p><p begin="03:24.827" end="03:29.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">昨日も 明日も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昨天也好 明天也罢 全都充满着希望呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki no u mo a su mo ki bo u de nu ri tsu bu shi te</span></p><p begin="03:30.103" end="03:35.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">希望で塗りつぶして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用希望一笔涂抹</span></p><p begin="03:35.602" end="03:39.701" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Fine day ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那一天 一直 想要在梦中看到呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Fine day zu 't to yu me wo mi ta i no</span></p><p begin="03:40.826" end="03:45.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">夢を見たいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都想做一场梦</span></p><p begin="03:46.305" end="03:56.538" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">深く 深く 砂の果てまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深入 深入 直到沙砾的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ka ku fu ka ku su na no ha te ma de</span></p><p begin="03:56.935" end="03:58.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Good night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此晚安吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Good night</span></p></div></body></tt>